// DOC020 lesson 04: importing a SOURCE returns its complete context.
//
// Run from the repository root:
// bin/protos protos/tutorials/08-language-interactions/04-source-full-context.protos
//
// The relative path belongs to this source's directory, not the CWD.

Pricing: import("./04-source-full-context/pricing.protos")
Again: import("./04-source-full-context/pricing.protos")

// A canonical SOURCE is cached once per Actor.
print(Pricing === Again)

// A Closure captures the SOURCE context containing its bindings.
print(Pricing.total())

// SOURCE has no separate public/private export boundary.
print(Pricing.internalPricingRule)
print(Pricing.basePrice)
